> them, and I don't seem to be allowed to apply them.

Normally, whenyou read a scroll of confuse monster, your hands will begin
to glow, and the next monster you hit will be confused.

If the scroll is blessed, the next few monsters you hit will be confused,
not just one.

If the scroll is cursed, however, you'll confuse yourself.

Try playing a priest for a while, and don't use the cursed scrolls, or
*do* use the cursed scrolls, just to see what happens.

